# The fluss-gateway image (docker/fluss-gateway/Dockerfile) builds with the
# repository root as its context, because the gateway depends on the in-tree
# fluss-rust workspace by path and the fluss-rs build script reads the
# canonical proto from fluss-rpc. Everything else — the Java modules, website,
# build outputs — is excluded so the context stays small.
*
!fluss-gateway
!fluss-rust
!fluss-rpc/src/main/proto

# Build artifacts inside the re-included trees.
fluss-gateway/target
fluss-rust/target
